THE REAL BENCHMARK — and it is QUARANTINED.

This data NEVER enters training and is NEVER used for model selection. It is read
by exactly one command: `python -m src.evaluate --webcam data/webcam_testset`.

Each teammate records ALL 29 signs (src.data.CLASSES) in varied lighting and
backgrounds, cropped through the shared src.crop contract. Layout is folder-per-
class with the person in the FILENAME, because evaluate._webcam_samples does not
recurse:

    data/webcam_testset/<CLASS>/<person>_<condition>_<seq>.jpg
    e.g. data/webcam_testset/A/qdoan_desklamp-plainwall_001.jpg

    record  : python scripts/record_webcam_testset.py --person <id> --all-classes \
                  --condition <lighting-background-tag>
    verify  : python scripts/check_webcam_coverage.py
    protocol: docs/WEBCAM_TESTSET_PROTOCOL.md   (#15)

Captures are gitignored — keep them on the shared drive, not in the repo. Do not
add synthetic/placeholder images here: everything under a class folder is scored.
